  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Program to support access to sustainable and inclusive productive credit for Colombian MSMEs.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Programa para apoyar el acceso al cr&#xe9;dito productivo sostenible e inclusivo de las MIPYMES colombianas.</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo general reformulado de la tercera operaci&#xf3;n individual bajo la CCLIP espromover el crecimiento sostenible mediante el financiamiento de inversiones quecontribuyan a la mejora de la productividad y sostenibilidad de las MIPYMEcolombianas. Los objetivos espec&#xed;ficos son: (i) incrementar la provisi&#xf3;n de cr&#xe9;ditopara financiamiento inclusivo de inversiones productivas realizadas pormicroempresas, (ii) incrementar la provisi&#xf3;n de cr&#xe9;dito para financiamiento deinversiones destinadas a la modernizaci&#xf3;n productiva, e (iii) incrementar laprovisi&#xf3;n de cr&#xe9;dito para financiamiento de inversiones productivas destinadas amejorar la sostenibilidad medioambiental de la producci&#xf3;n.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The reformulated general objective of the third individual operation under the CCLIP is to promote sustainable growth by financing investments that contribute to improving the productivity and sustainability of Colombian MSMEs. The specific objectives are: (i) increase the provision of credit for inclusive financing of productive investments made by microenterprises, (ii) increase the provision of credit for financing investments aimed at productive modernization, and (iii) increase the provision of credit for investment financing productive activities aimed at improving the environmental sustainability of production.</narrative>
  </description>
